OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEarly
OL,6,Fevening bright spells will give way to
OL,7,Fthickening cloud and rain from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest during the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight. Rain becoming heavy and
OL,10,Fpersistent overnight with a breeze.
OL,11,FStaying warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA wet start with some heavy
OL,14,Frain around, though brightening up
OL,15,Ffrom the northwest through the morning
OL,16,Fto leave a fine afternoon. Breezy, and
OL,17,Ffeeling fresher than recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
