OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday looks mainly dry with some
OL,7,Fsunshine and fairly gentle winds.
OL,8,FGradually turning wet and windy from
OL,9,Fthe northwest on Sunday, ahead of
OL,10,Fbrighter skies again on Monday.
